<title>HONG KONG: Hwa Kay Thai year net down 83 percent.</title>
<headline>Hwa Kay Thai year net down 83 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.2	  vs 7.3 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0	  vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  49.97 gain vs 84.57 gain (see note)</p>
<p>    Net			    12.47	vs 71.29 (see note)</p>
<p>    Turnover		     843.07     vs 911.97</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hwa Kay Thai Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 24-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Distributes Puma-brand products and operates restaurants.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain mainly on realisation of fixed assets.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings adjusted for 1-for-10 bonus issue during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is one H.K. cent vs four cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
